Example Usage

When given mixed items:

[
  { "type": "email", ... },
  { "type": "rss.daily-quote", ... },
  { "type": "rss.news", ... },
  { "type": "rss.socials", ... }
]

Render all as one unified newsletter in the correct order, applying type-based formatting for each section.